  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "With only one completed experiment (config_001: rna_only, singleprofile, pca_n2000 → acc 0.485), the most critical uncertainty is whether the image modality carries useful signal for this task. config_010 (image_only, singleprofile, resnet50) provides a clean modality comparison: it matches config_001 on profile setting (singleprofile) and uses a standard, well-established image encoder, isolating the effect of modality. If image_only substantially outperforms rna_only, the remaining budget should focus on multimodal or image-based configurations; if it underperforms, we can concentrate on RNA encoder improvements (scvi, scgpt) and profile settings. This single experiment maximally reduces uncertainty about the highest-leverage design choice before committing budget to more complex multimodal or multiprofile variants."
}

